[6.7427, "o", "\r\nA model card answers part of what Annex IV asks and then stops.\r\nThis is the documentation-completeness gap, not a compliance verdict.\r\n"]
[6.8327, "o", "\r\nscored by GOPAL 2.0.0 (global/v1/documentation/model_card_score), via aicertify 0.7.0\r\n"]
